Subject: [PATCH 34/50] AnnaThermostat: add open_therm_power_mode measurement

Map open_therm_power_mode to a Domoticz text sensor.

Signed-off-by: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>
Assisted-by: GPT-5.3-Codex

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [WIP]
---
 hardware/AnnaThermostat.cpp | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/hardware/AnnaThermostat.cpp b/hardware/AnnaThermostat.cpp
index 0b8ab5b15..0588a98de 100644
--- a/hardware/AnnaThermostat.cpp
+++ b/hardware/AnnaThermostat.cpp
@@ -1294,6 +1294,13 @@ void CAnnaThermostat::GetMeterDetails()
 					SendTextSensor(applianceIDhex, 16, batterypercentage, tmpstr, ApplianceName + " " + sname);
 				}
 			}
+			else if (sname == "open_therm_power_mode")
+			{
+				if (!tmpstr.empty())
+				{
+					SendTextSensor(applianceIDhex, 18, batterypercentage, tmpstr, ApplianceName + " " + sname);
+				}
+			}
             else if (sname == "central_heater_water_pressure")
             {
                 if (!tmpstr.empty())
